,\"children\":\"The shirts shown on this site are not for sale. Tedi occasionally gives out new shirt designs with cuts, but a shirt is not included with every appointment and availability is not guaranteed.\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"section\",\"The studio\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-900\",\"children\":\"The studio\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600\",\"children\":\"Please treat the studio and its collection with care. Contact Tedi before your appointment if you have questions about access or your visit.\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Contact\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-900\",\"children\":\"Contact\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600\",\"children\":\"Questions about these terms go to (732) 947-7359 or tedishairstudio@gmail.com.\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L21\",[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"promise\":\"$@23\"}]]}]\n1c:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n21:null\n24:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n23:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Privacy & Terms | Tedi's Hair Studio\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Private, by-appointment hair studio in Matawan, NJ. One chair, one barber, cuts done with intention. Inside Bellazio Collective.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"noindex\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://tedishairstudio.com/legal\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Tedi's Hair Studio | Private Barber Studio in Matawan, NJ\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Private, by-appointment hair studio in Matawan, NJ. One chair